    "program": {
      "version": 2,
      "source": "# EQU<w>: two w-bit inputs, one equality bit, LSB-first.\n# w = 2**k for an integer k >= 0; Upper/Lower take the full width.\n\ndef Upper<w>(a):\n    assert w >= 2 and (w & (w - 1)) == 0\n    x = bits(a, w)\n    return pack(x[w // 2:])\n\ndef Lower<w>(a):\n    assert w >= 2 and (w & (w - 1)) == 0\n    x = bits(a, w)\n    return pack(x[:w // 2])\n\ndef EQU<w>(a, b):\n    assert w >= 1 and (w & (w - 1)) == 0\n    if w == 1:\n        x = bits(a, 1)\n        y = bits(b, 1)\n        return 1 ^ (x[0] ^ y[0])\n    k = w // 2\n    hi = EQU<k>(Upper<w>(a), Upper<w>(b))\n    lo = EQU<k>(Lower<w>(a), Lower<w>(b))\n    return hi & lo\n\nreturn EQU<w>(a, b)\n",
      "limits": {
        "steps": 100000,
        "iterations": 10000,
        "total_steps": 5000000
      },
      "conditions": [
        "w >= 1",
        "w <= 64",
        "is_power_of_two(w)"
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "w": 2
      },
      "interface": {
        "inputs": [
          {
            "name": "a",
            "bits": "w"
          },
          {
            "name": "b",
            "bits": "w"
          }
        ],
        "outputs": [
          {
            "name": "c",
            "bits": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "description": "Vergleicht zwei w-Bit-Werte durch rekursive Halbierung. w ist eine positive Zweierpotenz; c ist genau dann 1, wenn a und b gleich sind. Basisfall: NOT(XOR(a,b)). Upper<w>/Lower<w> liefern je w//2 Bits."
  },
